Title: Hugo Ekitike: Newcastle explore record deal for Eintracht Frankfurt striker
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Newcastle have made a move to sign Eintracht Frankfurt striker Hugo Ekitike.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 63}}, {'Description': 'Sources said Newcastle are now exploring a potential deal to sign the Frenchman, who would likely cost more than £70m.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 113}}, {'Description': "Despite the interest in Ekitike, BBC Sport has been told Newcastle have no interest in selling last season's top scorer Alexander Isak who has been linked with clubs across Europe including Liverpool.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 188}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Hugo Ekitike'}]}
